SUMMARY:Weekend Warrior Tennis (Saturdays)
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis & More\nJoin us for
  friendly and sociable free rallies and possibly some informal matches for
  training and fun. We are beginner to intermediate levels but all are welc
 ome. We don’t allow formal instruction on our group-reserved courts\, al
 though giving some quick tips is OK so long as you’re not holding up oth
 ers waiting to play.\n\n⛑️ **Clinic Matches:** If we have to rotate pe
 ople in then we may play some clinic-style matches where everyone rotates 
 in evenly. There is no holding the court via wins so everyone has a chance
  to play regardless of skill level.\n\n🕊️ **Early Bird Start:** If yo
 u want to meet earlier than 9 AM (like 8 or 8:30) then please let us know 
 by the day before and we’ll see who can join you (usually I can do earli
 er).\n\n**🎾 Equipment:** Please bring your own racquet and water\, as w
 e don’t provide those. I always have some balls for at least one court\,
  but feel free to bring your own in case we need to branch out over more t
 han one court.\n\n👟 **Court Priority:** Those who are signed up and sho
 w up by 9 AM will have top priority for court space. Those who show up lat
 er have second priority while those who are wait-listed will have third pr
 iority. This is only in the event that we have to rotate people in.\n\n**
 🧯DISCLAIMER:** Courts are subject to availability and weather. If you m
 ake plans to attend please be prepared to cancel or adjust our location as
  needed. Furthermore\, by attending you agree to be fully responsible for 
 your own health and safety. Each person is responsible to take a break for
  rest and water at their own discretion.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleybal
 l/events/316838404/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261004T131749Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261004T131749Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: NJ Bowling, Volleyball, Tennis & More
UID:event_316378432@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261024T043314Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261024T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261024T220000
SUMMARY:🎃 Halloween Pickleball x Bachata Singles Social  👻🏓💃 $
 200 Best Costume Prize
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis & More\n🎃 Hallow
 een Pickleball Party | Bachata + Latin Dancing\n\nSaturday\, October 24 | 
 6:30 PM–10:00 PM\nPickleball Kingdom\nWomen 21+ | Men 25+\n\nYour Hallow
 een plans just got better.\n\n$25 early bird pricing. Price increase as it
  gets closer to the event. $50 at the door. Buy tickets at pbdates.org\n\n
 Dress up\, grab your friends—or come solo—and spend Saturday night pla
 ying pickleball\, learning Bachata\, dancing\, meeting new people\, and co
 mpeting for cash prizes.\n\nNo pickleball experience? Never danced Bachata
  before? Perfect. Beginners are welcome\, and no partner is needed.\n\nPla
 y as much or as little as you want. Come for the pickleball\, stay for the
  dancing\, costumes\, prizes\, giveaways\, and people.\n\n👑 $200 HALLOW
 EEN COSTUME CONTEST\n\nCome dressed to win.\n\nAttendees will vote for the
 ir favorite costumes during the party.\n\nHalloween King — $100 Cash Pri
 ze\nHalloween Queen — $100 Cash Prize\n\n$200 total in cash prizes. The 
 crowd decides the winners.\n\nWHAT’S HAPPENING\n\n🏓 Pickleball + rota
 ting games\n💃 Beginner-friendly Bachata lesson\n🎶 Latin dancing\n
 👑 Halloween King & Queen costume contest\n💵 $200 total cash prizes\n
 🎁 Giveaways and prizes throughout the night\n🍾 BYOB\n🎃 Costumes\,
  music\, games\, mingling\, and Halloween vibes\n\nCome with your friends\
 , your crew\, or completely solo.\n\nThis is designed to be social\, begin
 ner-friendly\, and easy to jump into—even if you’ve never picked up a 
 paddle or danced Bachata before.\n\nAGE REQUIREMENTS\n\nWomen: 21+\nMen: 2
 5+\n\nGuests must be 21+ to consume alcohol.\n\n🎟️ TICKET REQUIRED\n\
 nA Meetup RSVP does not reserve your spot.\n\nYou must purchase a ticket t
 hrough the official ticket link to attend.\n\nSpace is limited\, and ticke
 ts may sell out.\n\nEVENT POLICIES\n\nBy purchasing a ticket\, RSVPing\, a
 nd/or attending\, you acknowledge that pickleball\, dancing\, and other ph
 ysical activities involve inherent risks. You voluntarily assume those ris
 ks and agree to release the event organizers\, hosts\, instructors\, partn
 ers\, sponsors\, and venue from liability to the fullest extent permitted 
 by law.\n\nPhotos and videos may be taken throughout the event. By attendi
 ng\, you acknowledge that event photography and video may be used for soci
 al media\, promotional materials\, websites\, email marketing\, and other 
 event-related marketing purposes.\n\nAll ticket sales are final. No refund
 s.\n\nBy purchasing a ticket and attending the event\, you acknowledge and
  accept these policies.\n\n🎃 ONE BIG HALLOWEEN NIGHT\n\nPickleball. Bac
 hata. Costumes. Cash prizes. Giveaways. BYOB.\n\nDress up. Come play. Come
  dance. Meet some new people.\n\nGrab your ticket before spots are gone.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleybal
 l/events/316378432/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260902T001824Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260902T001824Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
