SUMMARY:Haunted House Trip - Wharton
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis & More\nHere we go!
  This next event is not for scaredy cats! We're headed to the 13th Hour Ha
 unted House\, 105 West Dewey Ave\, Wharton\, at 7:50 p.m. on Thursday\, Oc
 t. 22.\n\nThis event comes to you courtesy of our Whatsapp group chat.\n\n
 Looks like it'll be $45! Tickets can be purchased online or at the door. T
 hursday nights tend to have the shortest lines. We may have to split into 
 multiple groups depending on the number of attendees.\n\nHere's the websit
 e: https://13thhour.com/\n\nQuestions? Concerns? Ideas? Comment below\, or
  you can reach Andy Milone at 201-234-9609 (call or text).\n\nHope you'll 
 join us\, or consider attending one of our bowling\, volleyball\, tennis\,
  or other activities -> [www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volley
 ball](https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleyball)
