SUMMARY:Halloween Bar Crawl - Hoboken
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis & More\nCome join t
 he group for our second annual Halloween Bar Crawl in Hoboken.\n\nWe're te
 ntatively scheduled to start at The Shepherd & the Knucklehead of Hoboken\
 , 1313 Willow Ave.\, and then we'll be walking around from there. (tentati
 ve schedule below)\n\nOf course\, join us at any time. We'll try to post u
 pdates in the comments as the night unfolds. Or feel free to call or text 
 Andy Milone at 201-234-9609.\n\nIt's totally optional to partake in any of
  the costume wearing or beverage consumption. Feel free to just come and h
 ave a good time hanging with familiar faces and meeting new ones.\n\n**4:3
 0 p.m.**\nThe Shepherd & the Knucklehead of Hoboken - 1313 Willow Ave.\n**
 7 p.m.**\nThe Ale House - 1034 Willow Ave.\n**8 p.m.**\n10th & Willow Bar 
 & Grill - 935 Willow Ave\n**10 p.m.**\nFinnegan’s Pub - 734 Willow Ave.\
 n**11 p.m.**\nLouise & Jerry's - 329 Washington St.\n**12 a.m.**\nTally-Ho
  - 215 Washington St.\n\nPlease be smart about travel. The train station i
 s not far away and runs late. Parking can be a challenge\, but there are m
 ultiple parking garages\, including at 112 River St. If interested in carp
 ooling\, feel free to post below.\n\nThis is our fourth bar crawl!!!! The 
 idea comes to you courtesy of our Whatsapp group chat and was previously s
 uggested by Ray and Raymond\, two regular attendees of our events.\n\nQues
 tions? Suggestions? Concerns? You can reach out to Andy Milone at 201-234-
 9609 (call/text)\, or by message over Meetup or Whatsapp.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleybal
 l/events/316145065/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260816T193839Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260816T193839Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
